      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am deeply concerned by thoughts of ending your life, and I want you to know that your pain is valid, but you deserve a chance to live out your life on your own terms without the pain. Please reach out to a mental health crisis line or your doctor immediately, as these feelings need urgent, compassionate support right now. You are not alone, and there are people who can help you find a way to stay safe.",
